# Slice C fixture: a guarded pattern-headed `main` is not selected, so its guard is never evaluated.
# Expected: neither `guard-ran` nor `body` is printed.
@doc "Guard probe that prints `guard-ran` and returns true; visible output proves the guard was evaluated."
ping() = { print("guard-ran"); true }
@doc "Guarded `main(args)` clause whose guard calls `ping()`; its body prints `body` and returns 1 if ever run."
main(args) ? ping() = { print("body"); 1 }
print("top")
42
